WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.329
LILA BARTON
This is the first Christmas

00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:05.469
we've had together
in years.

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:06.548
CLINT BARTON
I love you guys.

00:00:08.442 --> 00:00:10.260
I'm making up
for some lost time.

00:00:12.508 --> 00:00:13.786
NEWSCASTER
Authorities are wondering if the

00:00:13.837 --> 00:00:17.809
masked vigilante, who terrorized
the city's underworld, is back.

00:00:19.862 --> 00:00:21.522
CLINT BARTON
The past has caught up with me.

00:00:22.815 --> 00:00:23.881
LILA BARTON
Should we be worried?

00:00:23.932 --> 00:00:25.627
CLINT BARTON
No, no, it's nothing.

00:00:25.678 --> 00:00:27.903
I'll be home for Christmas,
I promise.

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:30.343
♪♪

00:00:30.394 --> 00:00:34.882
♫ It's the most wonderful time ♫

00:00:36.067 --> 00:00:37.802
CLINT BARTON
When I wore this suit,

00:00:37.853 --> 00:00:39.295
I made a
whole lot of enemies.

00:00:43.826 --> 00:00:45.103
KATE BISHOP
You're Hawkeye!

00:00:45.154 --> 00:00:46.338
CLINT BARTON
Who the hell are you?

00:00:47.062 --> 00:00:48.387
KATE BISHOP
Some people have actually called me...

00:00:48.438 --> 00:00:49.933
[Bell ringing]

00:00:49.984 --> 00:00:51.218
...the world's
greatest archer.

00:00:53.626 --> 00:00:54.865
CLINT BARTON
Are you one of those people?

00:00:54.916 --> 00:00:57.244
♫ It's the most wonderful time ♫

00:00:57.295 --> 00:00:58.822
CLINT BARTON
Hey babe, I should be back

00:00:58.873 --> 00:01:00.477
in...
a day or two?

00:01:00.994 --> 00:01:02.056
Hang on a second.

00:01:02.095 --> 00:01:05.740
♫ With the kids jingle belling
And everyone telling you ♫

00:01:05.791 --> 00:01:06.947
CLINT BARTON
Things have gotten...

00:01:06.998 --> 00:01:08.341
[Rope snaps]
[Screaming]

00:01:08.392 --> 00:01:09.579
...more complicated.

00:01:09.752 --> 00:01:10.478
CLINT BARTON
[Sighs]

00:01:10.529 --> 00:01:16.146
♫ The most wonderful time
Of the year ♫

00:01:16.197 --> 00:01:17.247
KATE BISHOP
[Grunts]

00:01:17.298 --> 00:01:18.120
CLINT BARTON
[Sighs]

00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:19.794
♪♪

00:01:24.451 --> 00:01:30.289
♫ It's the most wonderful time
Yes, the most wonderful time ♫

00:01:30.340 --> 00:01:31.675
CLINT BARTON
This is too dangerous.

00:01:32.652 --> 00:01:33.570
Definitely not this one.

00:01:33.620 --> 00:01:34.683
KATE BISHOP
You don't have to say "definitely"

00:01:34.734 --> 00:01:35.620
like that.

00:01:36.769 --> 00:01:37.769
Holy...

00:01:38.425 --> 00:01:40.230
There are arrows
more dangerous than that one?

00:01:40.269 --> 00:01:46.780
♫ Of the year ♫

00:01:46.831 --> 00:01:48.671
CLINT BARTON
Ugh, this is some Christmas.

